{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42548","headline":"追和秦隐君辞荐之韵上陈侯乞归凤山 · 詹琲","name":"追和秦隐君辞荐之韵上陈侯乞归凤山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁言悦口是甘肥，独酌鹅儿噉翠微。\n蝇利薄於青纸扇，羊裘煖甚紫罗衣。\n心随倦鸟甘栖宿，目送征鸿远奋飞。\n击壤太平朝野客，凤山深处□生辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹琲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}